
  Step 5/9 • On conflict

  ✓ Worktrees: feat/a, feat/x
  · All — set by its flag only
  · Descendants — no worktree named has worktrees under it
  · Force — no worktree named has uncommitted changes

  Leave a rebase that stops on a conflict in progress, to resolve, instead of aborting it; the
  worktrees under it are skipped either way

▌› Abort it, the worktree left as it was
   Leave the rebase in progress, to resolve

